 "about_text": "CON_ is a contemporary art gallery in Nihonbashi-Bakurocho, Tokyo, that opened in April 2022. It was founded by director Hisatomo Kato together with co-founders GILLOCHINDOX☆GILLOCHINDAE and Keiichi Toyama. The gallery's program deliberately crosses contemporary art with other expressive cultures, especially music, treating them as parts of a single organic movement within Tokyo's urban culture. Exhibitions and projects grow out of ongoing dialogue and research with artists, with the aim of building new contexts from contemporary experience rather than simply displaying finished work. Beyond its Tokyo space, CON_ regularly presents its artists through solo and group presentations at international art fairs across Asia, Europe and the United States.",
